\f0\fs24 \cf0 Collingwood Report filed 12/12/2023 Data / Code\
\
This report relies on American Community Survey (ACS) data drawn from the tidy census package in R \'97 a publicly available statistical software program. Collingwood has written two functions that extracts these data, but the user might need to set up an api password, etc. to get the tidy census package to call the Census server and extract the necessary data. \
\
acs_vars.R \'97 all the variable names used that are extracted from the Census server\
harvest_functions.R \'97 Code that extracts the data, wrangles it, then relabels it; also then puts it into tabular format.\
\
main_execution_script.R \'97 This executes the functions and produces the tables.\
\
acs_2020.xlsx \'97 contains a list of the variable names \'97 these are the same variable names as 2021 ACS\'85}